<title>FRANCE: Rouen April 1-16 flour exports 31,675 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen April 1-16 flour exports 31,675 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 31,675 tonnes between April 1 and April 16, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 63,000 tonnes for the whole of April 1996.</p>
<p>April 1-16 exports included 17,650 tonnes for west Africa, 11,025 tonnes for Cuba, and 3,000 tonnes for Russia, they said.</p>
<p>In Rouen one ship was loading 20,000 tonnes of flour destined for Yemen.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
